.TH CUGPT 1 "2026-03-16" "cugpt 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cugpt, microgpt \- minimal single-layer GPT trained on a names dataset
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cugpt
.br
.B microgpt
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cugpt
and
.B microgpt
are C translations of Andrej Karpathy's
.I microgpt.py
\(em a minimal, dependency-free GPT implementation that demonstrates the
complete training and inference loop for a character-level language model.

Both programs train a 1-layer GPT-2-style transformer (RMSNorm, ReLU,
no biases) on 1,000 steps over a names dataset, then generate 20 sample
names via autoregressive inference.

.B microgpt
uses a Wengert tape for automatic differentiation and has no dependencies
beyond
.I libc
and
.IR libm .

.B cugpt
computes analytical gradients by hand (no autograd) and accelerates all
matrix-vector products with OpenBLAS, making it the faster variant.
.SH OPERATION
On first run, the dataset
.I input.txt
is downloaded automatically from Karpathy's makemore repository using
.BR curl (1)
or
.BR wget (1).
Subsequent runs reuse the local file.

Training runs for 1,000 steps with the Adam optimizer (lr=0.01, \(*b1=0.85,
\(*b2=0.99, linear decay).  Training loss is printed on a single updating line.
After training, 20 hallucinated names are printed.
.SH MODEL
.TP
.B Architecture
1-layer GPT-2 variant
.TP
.B vocab_size
27 (26 lowercase letters + BOS token)
.TP
.B n_embd
16
.TP
.B n_head
4  (head_dim = 4)
.TP
.B block_size
16
.TP
.B Parameters
4,192
.TP
.B Activation
ReLU (not GeLU)
.TP
.B Normalization
RMSNorm (no learnable scale)
.SH BUILDING
.B cugpt
uses a GNU autoconf build system.
The standard workflow is:
.PP
.RS
.nf
./configure && make
make check
make install
.fi
.RE
.PP
.BR configure (1)
detects the C compiler, libm, libopenblas, the location of
.IR cblas.h ,
and whether
.BR curl (1)
or
.BR wget (1)
is available for dataset download.
Optimisation flags default to the empirically fastest values:
.I \-O3 \-march=native \-ffast-math \-funroll\-loops
for
.B microgpt
and
.I \-O3 \-march=native \-ffast\-math \-flto
for
.BR cugpt .
Override with
.B CFLAGS_MICROGPT
or
.B CFLAGS_CUGPT
environment variables before running
.BR configure .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Dataset download failed or
.I input.txt
could not be opened.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I input.txt
Names dataset (downloaded on first run).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR configure (1),
.BR make (1),
.BR cc (1),
.BR python3 (1)
.PP
